&lt;tr style="height:18pt;min-height:18pt;"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・使用量自体の削減。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　（高耐用化、リサイクル化）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・水素還元製鉄対応のためのH2雰囲気下での各種材質の損傷量、損傷様式の調査把握。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・COURSE50プロセスを支える耐火物の研究開発。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:21.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;✓COURSE50実用化段階の実機搭載（2025～30）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:21.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;✓普及段階での実機搭載（～2050）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:18pt;min-height:18pt;"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="5" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#b7dde8;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;④CO₂削減投資推進&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:67.5pt;min-height:67.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・設備投資経済性評価にCO₂削減インセンティブ評価導入。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・全社での燃料転換推進、高効率設備導入。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・海外関連会社での燃料転換推進支援。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.2pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・再生可能エネルギーの導入検討 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・CO₂削減インセンティブ評価を継続実施。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
