&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(注) １  セグメント間取引については、相殺消去しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;２  金額は製造原価によっています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３  不動産事業に生産実績はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:18pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｂ．受注実績&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度における受注実績をセグメントごとに示すと以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;"&gt;
