  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingReclassificationAdjustmentsAndTaxEffectsRelatingToOtherComprehensiveIncomeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:18pt;"&gt;※１  その他の包括利益に係る組替調整額及び税効果額&lt;/p&gt;
